# Merchant dialogue. Same speaker-line and CHOICE syntax as bartender_greeting.dlg.
# The quest choices here demonstrate multi-stage quest gating with questAtStage.

NODE start
  MERCHANT: Welcome, welcome! Elena's Emporium has everything you need, and plenty you didn't know you wanted.

  CHOICE Let me see what you've got.
    GOTO browse
  END

  # Only appears when quest is at "started" (bartender sent you)
  CHOICE Marcus sent me about some work.
    REQUIRE questAtStage odd_jobs started
    GOTO odd_jobs_talk
  END

  # Only appears after talking to merchant about the job
  CHOICE The delivery is done.
    REQUIRE questAtStage odd_jobs talked_to_merchant
    GOTO quest_complete
  END

  CHOICE Tell me about the market.
    GOTO about_market
  END

  CHOICE Just browsing. Goodbye.
    GOTO farewell
  END

NODE browse
  MERCHANT: Take a look! I've got a fine map of the area if you're new around here. Only twenty gold, a bargain for not getting lost.

  # Conditional purchase: need enough gold (demonstrates: variableGreaterThan)
  # This choice uses *bold* around the item name.
  CHOICE I'll take the *map*. (20 gold)
    REQUIRE variableGreaterThan gold 19
    ADD variable gold -20
    SET flag boughtMap
    NOTIFY Bought a map (-20 gold)
    GOTO sold_map
  END

  CHOICE A bit rich for my blood.
    GOTO too_pricey
  END

NODE sold_map
  MERCHANT: Excellent choice! This'll keep you from wandering into the wrong part of town.

  CHOICE Thanks for the info.
    GOTO start
  END

NODE too_pricey
  MERCHANT: Ha! You'd pay twice that if you got lost in the docks at night. But no rush. I'll be here.

  CHOICE I'll keep looking around.
    GOTO start
  END

NODE odd_jobs_talk
  MERCHANT: Ah, Marcus sent you? Good man. I've got a shipment coming in and could use someone to keep an eye on things. Interested?

  CHOICE I'm in. What do you need?
    SET questStage odd_jobs talked_to_merchant
    ADD relationship merchant 1
    NOTIFY Quest Updated: Odd Jobs
    GOTO task_details
  END

  CHOICE Let me think about it.
    GOTO farewell
  END

NODE task_details
  MERCHANT: Head down to the docks at sundown. You'll meet my contact there, a woman named Ria. Make sure the cargo gets here in one piece.

  CHOICE Consider it done.
    GOTO farewell
  END

NODE quest_complete
  MERCHANT: Everything arrived in perfect condition! You've earned this: fifty gold, as promised. If I need help again, you'll be the first I call.
  SET questStage odd_jobs complete
  ADD variable gold 50
  ADD variable reputation 10
  ADD relationship merchant 3
  NOTIFY Quest Complete: Odd Jobs (+50 gold, +10 reputation)

  CHOICE Glad I could help.
    GOTO farewell
  END

NODE about_market
  MERCHANT: Market Square is the heart of this little town. You can find just about anything here if you know where to look. I've been trading here for fifteen years.

  CHOICE Thanks for the info.
    GOTO start
  END

NODE farewell
  MERCHANT: Safe travels! Come back anytime.
  END dialogue
